WEBVTT

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:18.700
Ayase?

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:20.580
Where are you?

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:23.710
Asuka Tennoji

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:23.710
Aina!

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:26.710
Aina Mikage

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:26.710
Tennoji!

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:29.610
Sorry, Aina.

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:31.010
I'm in a hurry.

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:34.970
Ayase...

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:39.240
Tennoji?

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:50.480
Could that be... a Z/X?

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:02.950
Barbaric Fiend  Balbals

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:19.740
Seiryuu Academy High School Student Dorms

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:22.740
Seiryuu Academy High School Student Dorms
December 27th 06:25

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:27.290
I haven't had that dream for a while.

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:48.120
Good morning, Dad, Mom!

00:03:48.510 --> 00:03:51.620
I'm seventeen now!

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:55.520
December 27th 10:52 Cafe Broccolo

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:55.630
What?! Today's your birthday, Aina?!

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:58.570
You should've said something sooner!

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:03.530
But telling someone about your 
own birthday is kinda weird...

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:04.490
Can't just stand here!

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:05.640
I've gotta get ready!

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:12.140
Cafe Broccolo Owner
Mr. Maru

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:10.910
Welcome.

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:12.730
Welcome!

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:15.650
Ayase!

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:18.150
Good morning, Aina.

00:04:19.170 --> 00:04:20.690
Sorry to bother you at work.

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:22.700
No, it's fine.

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:24.760
Ayase Kamiyugi

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:24.200
I'm on break.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.750
You said you were working here.

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:29.630
So you came to see me?

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:30.840
No...

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:32.680
I'm sorry about yesterday.

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:35.990
I just vanished, right?

00:04:35.990 --> 00:04:37.860
So I wanted to apologize.

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:40.170
No, it's just fine.

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:43.420
<b>Transportation Shut Down
Widespread Power Outage in Kobe</b>

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:43.420
<b>Power Lines Cut
Chaos at Sudden Power Outage</b>

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:43.420
Were you okay after that?

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:45.900
Yeah, I guess.

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:47.320
Hey, it's Ayase!

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:51.180
I told you not to call me by my first name.

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:54.220
What are you doing here?

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:56.940
This is where I work.

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:58.940
Wait, you two know each other?

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:01.680
Yes. We just met yesterday, though.

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:02.400
Oh, okay.

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:03.600
Perfect.

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:05.700
Ayase, do you have some time today?

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:07.490
I don't have any plans for tod—

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:09.810
I told you not to call me by my first name!

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:11.550
Sorry, sorry.

00:05:11.550 --> 00:05:14.600
You keep doing that!

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:16.550
Do you never learn?

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:23.460
So you're the one Tennoji was looking for.

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:25.590
Hm? Did you say something?

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:27.370
No, nothing.

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:30.970
This is getting even better!

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:32.760
This place again?

00:05:31.780 --> 00:05:35.750
Azumi Kagamihara         Sword Sniper  Rigel

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:34.360
I want curry.

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:37.230
There are lots of places that serve curry.

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:40.890
You came again?

00:05:40.890 --> 00:05:42.610
Azumi, Rigel!

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:45.110
Rigel?

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:47.310
You want more of the boss's curry?

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:48.630
Y-Yeah.

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:50.180
It really is good, huh?

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:52.840
But you just ate so much two days ago.

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:55.120
But I don't think Rigel does.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:56.860
I don't really...

00:05:56.860 --> 00:05:59.120
There are other places to get curry.

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:01.450
But you're staying with Azumi anyway.

00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:03.130
She's a good friend, huh?

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:04.280
Yeah.

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:06.780
Friend?

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:08.130
I'm Azumi's friend?

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:09.470
Of course!

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:11.010
What's wrong, Rigel?

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:12.890
Stop saying it like that.

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:16.140
Why? It's cute, Rigel—

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:17.920
I'll shoot.

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:20.010
Yes, ma'am.

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:24.710
Tennoji can make friends 
with anybody right away.

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:26.700
Was that how it was with you?

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:29.060
I never asked him to.

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:33.820
I'm shy, and I stumble when I talk.

00:06:33.820 --> 00:06:37.660
I wish I could be like him.

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:41.170
What?

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:46.820
A nice, cool, and sometimes helpless boy?

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:49.540
No, that's...

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:51.950
You don't have to hide it.

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:58.310
Why are we at the same table?

00:06:58.310 --> 00:06:59.690
Ask him.

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:02.950
Okay, just one more!

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:05.940
The person who pushed Ichiro off the cliff,

00:07:06.310 --> 00:07:08.990
killed Jiro and made it look like a suicide,

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:11.950
and made that gang attack Saburo is...

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:16.470
The Proud  Fierte

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:14.470
Is...?

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:17.570
<i>Fierte!</i>

00:07:17.570 --> 00:07:19.580
I didn't do it!

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:21.960
<i>Didn't do what?</i>

00:07:22.410 --> 00:07:24.960
Nothing. Just talking to myself.

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:26.780
So what did you need?

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:28.880
<i>Can you come to Broccolo right now?</i>

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:30.920
Right now?

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:33.740
A birthday party?

00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:34.210
That's right.

00:07:34.210 --> 00:07:37.070
Today is Aina's seventeenth birthday.

00:07:37.070 --> 00:07:39.010
We're gonna throw her a big party!

00:07:39.010 --> 00:07:41.690
Azumi, what's a birthday party?

00:07:43.430 --> 00:07:44.440
Seriously?

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:46.940
I saw it on TV!

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:51.060
On someone's birthday, everyone gets 
together and celebrates, right?

00:07:51.060 --> 00:07:52.210
That's right.

00:07:52.210 --> 00:07:55.380
So in other words, you record 
the date you were manufactured,

00:07:55.380 --> 00:07:57.180
and everyone celebrates it?

00:07:58.170 --> 00:07:59.840
That's a strange custom.

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:04.290
What country are you from, Rigel?

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:06.960
She's... from far away.

00:08:07.390 --> 00:08:08.780
Let's do it, Rigel!

00:08:09.370 --> 00:08:11.720
It's your first birthday party, right?

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:13.470
But...

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:15.470
It'll be fun!

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:17.980
Fine.

00:08:17.980 --> 00:08:21.480
This experience might help us in a future battle.

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:23.620
I guess I don't have a choice.

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:25.150
Ayase...

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:26.670
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:29.410
It's just that being with him annoys me.

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:31.240
The party sounds like great fun.

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:32.930
Thank you.

00:08:33.430 --> 00:08:35.240
But the café...

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:37.770
Don't worry.

00:08:37.770 --> 00:08:39.110
Boss...

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:42.440
There aren't many customers today.

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:46.280
I'll handle things myself 
for the rest of the day.

00:08:46.850 --> 00:08:48.150
But...

00:08:48.760 --> 00:08:52.450
Okay, I'll make a cake, 
so everybody help me!

00:08:54.330 --> 00:08:55.260
First...

00:08:57.160 --> 00:08:58.890
Sift the flour.

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:00.140
Right!

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:11.150
Next, beat the eggs.

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:17.500
Nice, Rigel!

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:23.750
Whoa! Stop! Stop!

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:27.670
Now melt the butter over the burner.

00:09:31.890 --> 00:09:32.900
No!

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:35.210
That's not the right way, Fierte!

00:09:36.120 --> 00:09:40.930
Then you pour the mixture 
in the pan, and bake it!

00:09:43.090 --> 00:09:45.150
Something smells like it's burning...

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:49.690
Who set the temperature 
to 280 degrees Celsius?!

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:50.970
Was that wrong?

00:09:50.970 --> 00:09:52.860
It should be 180 degrees!

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:57.200
How did this happen?

00:09:57.910 --> 00:10:00.710
We used up all the ingredients, too.

00:10:02.210 --> 00:10:03.630
Thank you, everybody!

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:07.930
I could really tell you wanted 
to celebrate my birthday.

00:10:07.930 --> 00:10:09.210
So it's all right.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:12.470
Even without a cake, 
we can have a party.

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:13.930
Aina...

00:10:13.930 --> 00:10:15.240
Not happening!

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:20.720
A birthday party without a cake is 
like curry without garam masala!

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:22.970
That's not curry at all.

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:24.460
Right?

00:10:24.460 --> 00:10:27.980
I'm not sure I understand.

00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:31.730
Anyway, we need a cake, and that's that.

00:10:32.170 --> 00:10:35.480
Y-You... You're right.

00:10:36.430 --> 00:10:38.490
Fine. Let's go.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:40.990
Go where?

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:44.740
If we don't have ingredients, 
we'll just have to buy them.

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:49.270
December 27th 13:42 Kobe City

00:10:48.550 --> 00:10:50.750
Okay, we've got everything we need.

00:10:51.020 --> 00:10:54.280
Let's head back and try 
making those cakes again.

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:55.390
Right.

00:10:55.850 --> 00:10:58.960
Bake the cake...

00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:01.760
Happy birthday...

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:04.760
Happy birthday today and tomorrow!

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:10.160
Wait!

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:12.460
Wait, I'll get it for you.

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:13.290
Really?

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:14.520
Yeah!

00:11:56.840 --> 00:12:00.280
December 27th 14:17 Kobe East Tunnel

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:25.590
Oww...

00:12:27.490 --> 00:12:29.560
Jeez.

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:42.570
Sinister Fiend  Malice

00:12:52.320 --> 00:12:53.330
I can't move?

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:56.330
I love that darkness...

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:03.340
It's Aina's happy...

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:06.030
Huh? Where's Aina?

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:08.270
She was just behind us.

00:13:08.270 --> 00:13:10.640
It seems we've gotten separated.

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:13.350
She's not a child. She'll find 
her way back on her own.

00:13:13.630 --> 00:13:18.490
What? She's the star of the show 
today. We can't leave her.

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:20.610
Fierte?

00:13:20.890 --> 00:13:22.870
I feel an evil presence.

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:24.860
<i>Ayase.</i>

00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:27.410
<i>It's a Diabolus.</i>

00:13:27.670 --> 00:13:29.310
Diabolus?

00:13:29.310 --> 00:13:33.830
<i>Yeah. They're trouble; they kill 
people and steal their life span.</i>

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:37.420
<i>No human could escape from one.</i>

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:39.420
I've got a bad feeling.

00:13:39.780 --> 00:13:41.660
You think it got Aina?

00:13:41.660 --> 00:13:43.060
I don't know.

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:44.670
Fierte, can you sense her?

00:13:45.150 --> 00:13:46.870
Yes, from that mountain.

00:13:46.870 --> 00:13:47.930
Okay!

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:55.190
Wonderful.

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:57.940
Dark, thick, and endless...

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:01.440
Endlessly deep.

00:14:03.640 --> 00:14:04.690
Terror.

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:06.450
Despair.

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:13.020
And a growing ego that 
you're not even aware of.

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:24.710
You are worthy of being 
sacrificed to my mask.

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:38.480
Asuka, look!

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:40.170
Right! Go!

00:14:50.270 --> 00:14:53.740
Now, sacrifice yourself to my mask!

00:14:56.010 --> 00:14:57.060
Aina?

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:09.840
What is that?

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:10.860
Activate!

00:15:10.860 --> 00:15:13.760
Black Blade  Sieger

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:21.270
Aina!

00:15:23.210 --> 00:15:24.540
Are you okay?

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:25.520
Aina!

00:15:56.410 --> 00:15:59.560
The darkness has grown full!

00:16:07.710 --> 00:16:10.190
What, we're done already?

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:14.280
Aina!

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:17.250
Are you hurt?

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:18.200
No!

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:22.870
Did we scare you?

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:24.210
I'm sorry, Aina.

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:29.160
I'm sure you figured it out 
already, but Fierte is a Z/X.

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:32.930
And I'm a Z/X user.

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:34.490
No...

00:16:34.490 --> 00:16:35.830
It's true.

00:16:35.830 --> 00:16:36.870
Not just me.

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:38.770
Ayase and Azumi are, too.

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:42.650
You were all hiding this from me?

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:44.230
That's not true.

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:45.730
It's not like that, Aina.

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:49.230
We just didn't want to scare you, that's all.

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:53.200
Nobody here is going to start fights in town.

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:56.490
They're never going to hurt any civilians.

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:58.990
So don't be scared.

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:02.760
Let's go home, Aina.

00:17:02.760 --> 00:17:05.120
N-No...

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:06.120
No!

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:07.630
Aina?

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:09.640
No!

00:17:09.640 --> 00:17:11.110
Wait, Aina!

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:12.490
Aina!

00:17:12.490 --> 00:17:13.880
Ayase!

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:25.910
December 27th 16:40 Kobe - Fountain Park

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:31.310
I'm sorry.

00:17:31.930 --> 00:17:34.150
I was just surprised.

00:17:34.810 --> 00:17:36.200
I don't blame you.

00:17:36.770 --> 00:17:39.790
Normal people don't see Z/X very often.

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:44.200
I told you I lost my family 
before I came to Kobe, right?

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:48.910
Actually, they were killed... by a Z/X.

00:17:50.410 --> 00:17:53.080
So I'm scared of them!

00:17:53.720 --> 00:17:54.920
Mine, too.

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:58.860
My parents were also killed by a Z/X.

00:17:58.860 --> 00:17:59.930
Just like you.

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:02.430
Then how can you be with one?

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:07.440
For revenge.

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:11.900
Revenge?

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:13.440
Yes.

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:19.160
I'll never forgive the Z/X that 
took my parents from me.

00:18:20.550 --> 00:18:21.780
So I'll take revenge.

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:24.580
I'll do anything for that.

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:28.000
I'll use any tool I can.

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.880
Even another Z/X.

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:34.250
We're not the same.

00:18:35.290 --> 00:18:37.920
I'm not strong like you.

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:42.950
I hate the Z/X, but I've 
never wanted to take revenge.

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:46.270
So I can't use a Z/X.

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:49.060
That's fine.

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:51.510
You shouldn't take revenge.

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:54.830
Tennoji is different, right?

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:58.810
He can make friends with anybody.

00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:00.890
Even a Z/X.

00:19:01.460 --> 00:19:04.310
But I'm different.

00:19:05.030 --> 00:19:12.040
Now that I know Fierte is a Z/X, 
I can't be friends with her anymore.

00:19:14.260 --> 00:19:18.630
I know that you and Tennoji aren't bad people.

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:20.550
But...

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:28.060
Don't try to talk to me anymore, Ayase.

00:19:28.510 --> 00:19:31.750
No... Kamiyugi.

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:47.660
December 27th 19:36 Cafe Broccolo

00:19:49.430 --> 00:19:51.170
I see.

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:53.980
Where are you going?

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:55.210
The kitchen.

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:56.420
What are you going to do?

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:58.480
What else?

00:19:58.480 --> 00:20:00.170
We bought the ingredients.

00:20:00.890 --> 00:20:03.180
But Aina won't...

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:04.830
I told you.

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:10.000
A birthday party without a cake is 
like curry without garam masala.

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:11.920
That's not curry at all.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:16.550
You're right.

00:20:16.550 --> 00:20:17.690
Yes.

00:20:28.430 --> 00:20:29.470
Seiryuu Academy High School Student Dorms

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:31.200
Seiryuu Academy High School Student Dorms
December 27th 23:51

00:20:58.480 --> 00:21:00.730
<b>Aina</b>

00:21:02.010 --> 00:21:03.500
Tennoji...

00:21:10.010 --> 00:21:11.860
Do you hate the Z/X?

00:21:14.440 --> 00:21:17.750
What was it that stole 
your parents from you?

00:21:24.870 --> 00:21:26.760
What was it that stole your friends?

00:21:28.410 --> 00:21:30.860
What about the man you love?

00:21:30.860 --> 00:21:32.100
The Z/X.

